which you have a working proficiency. Easy peasy. Return to tips Core Skills Mindfully select the skills that help you perform at your best. Core skills are a way for employers to understand you so they can make informed decisions. So be honest ;) Return to tips Additional Skills Have more skills to share? Do it here! Return to tips Online Presence Perhaps you have a stellar blog or a great LinkedIn profile. Share the links here for the employer to explore. Return to tips Highlights The Highlights section appears at the very top of your application. It’s pretty important, so make it count! Highlight key achievements, mention things that stand out about you as a person and your experiences, and if you can, give them a bit of insight into your personality. Help them remember you. You’re amazing, so tell them. Return to tips Cover Letter If you choose Write Cover Letter, you can write it right here in the application. Or you can attach your cover letter (PDF recommended). Return to tips Resume/CV Here you can attach your resume. Attaching your resume here will not overwrite any other info you’ve already imported. We recommend you upload your resume as a PDF file. File types: .pdf,.docx,.doc,.rtf,.txt,.odt Maximum file size is 20 MB. Return to tips Attachments Some employers want to see more. Be sure to check the application to see if they request any additional documentation. Maximum file size is 20 MB. Return to tips Sorry, but it looks like you've missed something. Return to tips Need more help? Uploading file, please wait... Cancel upload × Error: The resume uploaded couldn't be imported properly. Our system only accepts certain file types (.doc, .docx, .pdf for example). If you can convert your file to one of these file types, we should be able to import all of your information. If you experience any issues, you can email us at [email protected] . Close Window Log in to your Alongside Account Wrong Username/Email and password combination. Sorry, but it looks like y